# PRIVACY POLICY — CAMBIO VE
**Last updated:** June 22, 2026

## SUMMARY
- **We do not collect any personal data.**
- The app **contains no advertising**.
- **No accounts or sign-up required.**

The **Cambio VE** app ("the App", "we") respects your privacy. This policy explains how your information is handled — or rather, how it is NOT handled — when you use the App.

---

### 1. INFORMATION WE COLLECT
We do not collect any personal data. The App requires no registration and does not ask for your name, email, phone number, location, contacts, or any other identifiable information. We do not build user profiles or track your activity.

### 2. USAGE DATA AND ANALYTICS
We do not use analytics tools, tracking cookies, advertising identifiers, or similar technologies to collect information about you or your device.

### 3. ADVERTISING
The App contains no advertising of any kind and no third-party ad networks.

### 4. THIRD-PARTY CONNECTIONS
To display up-to-date exchange rates, the App queries public financial data sources:
- **Central Bank of Venezuela (BCV):** official US Dollar and Euro rates.
- **Binance P2P:** market average for USDT and USDC.

These requests only download public rate data. No personal information about you is sent to these services. Such third parties may log basic technical connection data (such as IP address) under their own policies, beyond our control.

### 5. DEVICE PERMISSIONS
The App only requires Internet access to fetch exchange rates. It does not request access to the camera, microphone, location, contacts, storage, or any other sensitive device data.

### 6. DATA STORED ON THE DEVICE
Any preferences (such as calculator values) are stored only locally on your device and are never transmitted to us or to third parties. You can delete this data at any time by uninstalling the App or clearing its data.

### 7. CHILDREN'S PRIVACY
The App is not directed to children under 13 and does not knowingly collect data from them. Since we collect no data from any user, there is no risk of processing children's information.

### 8. SECURITY
Because we do not collect or store personal data on servers, there is no personal information that could be compromised. Connections to rate sources use secure protocols (HTTPS) where available.

### 9. CHANGES TO THIS POLICY
We may update this policy from time to time. The "Last updated" date will reflect any changes. Continued use of the App after an update constitutes acceptance of the current policy.

### 10. CONTACT
If you have questions about this privacy policy, you can reach us through our official Telegram channel:  
[https://t.me/cambiasves](https://t.me/cambiasves)
